{
 "_readme": "How the Explorazone venue photos were made, so they can be rebuilt without storing brand photos in this repository. Each photo is a full-width crop of a 1080x1920 Story ad image from the Explorazone ad account. To rebuild: list the account's ad images (Meta Ads connector, ads_get_ad_images), find the image whose URL contains source_ad_image, download it, crop x, y, w, h, save as assets/photos/<key>.jpg (JPEG quality 90). Older small crops (lab, lab2, vr, jungle, mirror, floor, tunnel, racing, tubes, infinity, plasma, foliage, lasers_green, tubes_purple) came from square and 4:5 ads; recrop them by eye if needed, or prefer the large photos below. Added 19 Oct 2026: 18 more photos from the October half-term static ads (Explorazone_ht_NN_*_9x16.png); in those ads the photo sits under the logo, so crop from y 272 to 864.",
 "logo": {
  "note": "Current lockup \"EXPLORAZONE / SCIENCE DISCOVERY LAB\" (red box, white text), cropped from the half-term static ads of 17 Oct 2026 (ad image Explorazone_ht_10_mixed_ages_9x16.png, url contains 851925329_122145766971157697): crop x 47, y 159, w 305, h 75, then upscaled 2x with Lanczos. Replace with the master logo file when the brand owner supplies it."
 },
